## Quick Reference: Lesson 004

### Memory Read Instruction

| Instruction | Purpose | T-states | Bytes |
|-------------|---------|----------|-------|
| LD A,(HL) | Read byte at address HL into A | 7 | 1 |
| LD A,(BC) | Read byte at address BC into A | 7 | 1 |
| LD A,(DE) | Read byte at address DE into A | 7 | 1 |
| LD A,(nn) | Read byte at address nn into A | 13 | 3 |

### Compare Instruction

| Instruction | Purpose | T-states | Bytes |
|-------------|---------|----------|-------|
| CP n | Compare A with immediate value n | 7 | 2 |
| CP r | Compare A with register (B,C,D,E,H,L) | 4 | 1 |
| CP (HL) | Compare A with byte at address HL | 7 | 1 |

**Important:** CP performs A - value but doesn't store result. Only sets flags.

### Conditional Jumps (Relative)

| Instruction | Condition | Flag state | T-states |
|-------------|-----------|------------|----------|
| JR Z,label | Jump if Zero | Z = 1 | 12 (taken) / 7 (not) |
| JR NZ,label | Jump if Not Zero | Z = 0 | 12 (taken) / 7 (not) |
| JR C,label | Jump if Carry | C = 1 | 12 (taken) / 7 (not) |
| JR NC,label | Jump if No Carry | C = 0 | 12 (taken) / 7 (not) |

**Range:** JR can jump -126 to +129 bytes from current position

### Flags After CP

**CP performs A - n internally:**

| Result | Z flag | C flag | Meaning |
|--------|--------|--------|---------|
| A = n | 1 | 0 | Values equal |
| A > n | 0 | 0 | A is greater |
| A < n | 0 | 1 | A is less |

### Common Patterns

**Check if empty:**
```asm
LD A,(HL)
CP 0
JR Z,IsEmpty
; Not empty
```

**Check if specific value:**
```asm
LD A,(HL)
CP 42
JR Z,IsFortyTwo
; Not 42
```

**Check range (is A between 10 and 20?):**
```asm
CP 10
JR C,TooSmall        ; A < 10
CP 21
JR NC,TooBig         ; A >= 21
; A is 10-20
```

### Performance Comparison

| Operation | Assembly | BASIC | Advantage |
|-----------|----------|-------|-----------|
| Read + compare | ~14 T-states | ~1000 T-states | ~70× faster |
| Read + 2 compares | ~25 T-states | ~2000 T-states | ~80× faster |
| 100 position checks | ~1400 T-states | ~100000 T-states | ~70× faster |

